{
    "title": "Star Girl: Love Story",
    "description": "Star girl: Love story is one of the leading choices puzzle games out there that will get you hooked on!\r\n\r\nYou're now in or no longer in a relationship, or you're never in love. Romance, drama, suspense, surprise and more - Star girl: Love story would take you to the most impressed puzzle game ever and offer a huge collection of love story with for any taste. This is the app where you can say: My choices \u2013 My love story.\r\n\r\nSee potential lovers, jealous rivals and unexpected puzzles come to life in Star girl: Love story, then you're gonna consider making choices, this one or that one, for what is coming next to Star girl and her boyfriend.\r\n\r\n\r\nYour choices are what it takes to build the relationships, creat the best interesting love story! Choose your own adventure and roleplay your way to the story you love in this breathtaking and addictive love story puzzle game.\r\n\r\nGame features:\r\n\u2b50 Don\u2019t get fooled!\r\nEach level presents you with multiple choices - make the right answers to proceed. Wrong answers will result in painful but funny outcomes to our Star girl and her boyfriend!\r\n\u2b50 Unique story and art style\r\nYou cannot find the impressive story-telling game somewhere else. Let us surprise you!\r\n\u2b50 Simple and addicting gameplay!\r\nOnce you start you will want to keep solving the upcoming puzzles. This is the best puzzler out there!\r\n\u2b50 So many stories to love!\r\nEach level is unique. So many different puzzles for you to solve.\r\n\u2b50 It is that game from those ads?\r\nYes, it actually is.\r\n\u2b50 Do you want to be a Star?\r\nGood luck!\r\n\r\nWhether you are a fan of puzzlers, word games, trivia games, quiz games, brain teasers, or just want to have a good time, then Star girl: Love story is the game for you!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Star girl: Love story is one of the leading choices puzzle games out there that will get you hooked on!<br><br>You&#39;re now in or no longer in a relationship, or you&#39;re never in love. Romance, drama, suspense, surprise and more - Star girl: Love story would take you to the most impressed puzzle game ever and offer a huge collection of love story with for any taste. This is the app where you can say: My choices \u2013 My love story.<br><br>See potential lovers, jealous rivals and unexpected puzzles come to life in Star girl: Love story, then you&#39;re gonna consider making choices, this one or that one, for what is coming next to Star girl and her boyfriend.<br><br><br>Your choices are what it takes to build the relationships, creat the best interesting love story! Choose your own adventure and roleplay your way to the story you love in this breathtaking and addictive love story puzzle game.<br><br>Game features:<br>\u2b50 Don\u2019t get fooled!<br>Each level presents you with multiple choices - make the right answers to proceed. Wrong answers will result in painful but funny outcomes to our Star girl and her boyfriend!<br>\u2b50 Unique story and art style<br>You cannot find the impressive story-telling game somewhere else. Let us surprise you!<br>\u2b50 Simple and addicting gameplay!<br>Once you start you will want to keep solving the upcoming puzzles. This is the best puzzler out there!<br>\u2b50 So many stories to love!<br>Each level is unique. So many different puzzles for you to solve.<br>\u2b50 It is that game from those ads?<br>Yes, it actually is.<br>\u2b50 Do you want to be a Star?<br>Good luck!<br><br>Whether you are a fan of puzzlers, word games, trivia games, quiz games, brain teasers, or just want to have a good time, then Star girl: Love story is the game for you!",
